data: {"id": "b3f99685476a47f0-final", "run_id": "b3f99685476a47f0", "seq": 1243, "ts_ms": 1788792238809, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器反复重启。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `BackOff restarting failed container app` (fact-20d136c72cf2) | 确认 Kubernetes 因容器反复失败而执行指数退避重启策略。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `exit_code: 78` (fact-95edea47cc48, fact-93ab61fcf869) | 直接表明应用进程异常终止，非资源超限导致的 OOMKilled。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` | `request.memory: 24Mi`, `limit.memory: 96Mi` (fact-0069d155dafe, fact-7a3e1aba274b) | 提供容器资源限制配置，用于排除资源不足导致的进程终止。 |\n| 4 | Logging | `elasticsearch` | `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误模式重复 8 次，时间范围 `2026-09-07T14:35:23Z` 至 `14:41:46Z` (fact-...) | 指出导致进程终止的具体应用层原因为缺失配置项。 |\n| 5 | Tracing | `tempo` | Trace `b3559561...` 显示 `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit` 及 HTTP 500 (fact-0022d2f0ccba) | 关联具体链路确认应用因配置缺失主动退出。 |\n| 6 | Tracing | `deepflow` | L7 Flow 聚合显示 `/work` 接口 9 次请求返回 500 状态 (fact-...) | 佐证应用持续抛出 500 错误并失败的行为模式。 |\n\n**证据综合：**\nKubernetes 事件 (1) 证实 Pod 处于重启循环中。K8s 状态 (2) 与 Trace 上下文 (5) 共同锁定了终止原因为应用逻辑异常（退出码 78 且标记为 config_missing_exit），而非 Kubernetes 基础设施问题。日志模式 (4) 进一步将根因具体化为“缺失配置”，且 Trace 的 HTTP 请求 (6) 与日志时间窗口高度一致，形成完整证据链。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失配置依赖 → CONFIG_MISSING 异常抛出并返回 HTTP 500 → 进程以 exit code 78 终止 → Kubernetes 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启机制\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 中的 `app` 容器因**应用程序配置缺失**导致启动或运行时逻辑失败。应用代码抛出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误并返回 HTTP 500 状态码，直接导致进程以**退出码 78** 非正常终止（证据 2, 4, 5）。由于容器以非零码退出，Kubernetes 识别到容器失败并进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态进行反复重启（证据 1, 3）。\n\n**未知与局限：**\n输入事实中未提供缺失的具体配置 Key 名称（如 `fact-unknowns` 所示），也未包含 `ConfigMap workload-code` 的详细内容以对比预期配置与实际内容的差异细节。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 86.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 86.3s (Evidence 77.0s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 111.394, "metrics": {"run_id": "b3f99685476a47f0", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 111.4006576538086, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 111400.6576538086, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 107120.94449996948, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplic